  "description": "From the moment Princess Juciellia Brianna Panterin was born, she was surrounded by expectations. As the first white tiger beastkin to be born in a hundred years, she is destined to save the world from destruction. Despite growing up adored by many, Juciellia struggles with her powers and fears she may not grow strong enough to protect her loved ones. With time slipping by and calamity drawing near, will the White Tiger Princess rise to meet the hopes of all before it’s too late?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
